    "committer": "Hengxin Pan <pan.h@wehi.edu.au>",
    "message": "Count permutation ties up to rounding so p-values match across platforms\n\nPermuted scores within sqrt(.Machine$double.eps) (relative) of the\nobserved score now count as reaching it, in the row-by-row engine, the\nvectorised engine and the shared ks/gsea0 null. x86_64 accumulates sums\nin long double, so exact ties flipped on Linux/Windows and\ntest-scoring-fast.R failed on R-universe. Bump to 0.99.6.\n",
    "time": 1794277476
  },
